  "changelog": {
    "2.0 (2026-11-04)": [
      "Team decision (Leen, 2026-11-04) after test round 2 (log 6.12). 25 -> 17 R1 sounds + adhan (R2), 7 categories + religious.",
      "Merged: fire_alarm + alarm -> alarm; crowd + laughter -> crowd; rain + thunder -> rain.",
      "Removed: explosion, clapping, footsteps, traffic, skid (reasons in removed_internal).",
      "Category home_devices renamed to devices_alerts ('الأجهزة والتنبيهات'); road = horn only; nature = rain/storm.",
      "Priority: alarm hidden when emergency_siren fires (old crowd<-laughter and traffic<-skid rules no longer needed).",
      "Driving mode: emergency_siren + alarm + horn. Sleep: emergency_siren + alarm.",
      "phone_tone and rain/storm are re-tested in round 3. No model retraining, no threshold change."
    ]
  }
